/Type /Annot
/Subtype /Link
/F 4
/Border [0 0 0]
/Rect [66.62178 646.92322 1373.12183 688.17322]
/A 582 0 R
/StructParent 17
/Contents (The conclusion of JioHotstar reflects its significant role in India'sdigital entertainment landscape. Following the merger betweenJioCinema and Disney+ Hotstar, JioHotstar has become the largestpremium streaming platform, offering over 100,000 hours ofcontent across 17 languages and covering major global sportingevents. The platform aims to provide a unified content ecosystem,combining the strengths of both JioCinema and Disney+ Hotstar,and is positioned to compete with major players like Netflix andAmazon Prime Video. With a focus on regional content andinnovative viewing experiences, JioHotstar is set to dominate theIndian OTT market, making high-quality content more accessible to abroader audience)
>>
endobj
